      "body": "## Motivation\n\nOn ROCm, `--enable-deterministic-inference` without `--attention-backend` picks FA3, which is not available on ROCm, so the server fails to start (for example in `test_return_routed_experts.py`).\n\n## Modifications\n\nOn HIP, pick Triton instead.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nOn MI350X, a server started with only `--enable-deterministic-inference` now starts with Triton and generates normally.\n\nCo-author-with: @JessicaJiang-123\n",
